cb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cDikiEyzUtEQ7kNvwFdqCKK&_nc_oc=AdrlJgyUMRFCfMZ-lbI8-p0W7HyRC7KMnmmSePwkuhKM385KTgZrt4nlUUFmmUG9PdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSysERAUnRysciI4BbhuoPv0wVfv1zGvjocHmfiSk6ylg&oe=6B0DCD6A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SBS-1.png", "id": "1889401618406419", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_1889401621739752_8904061124924124698_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tSAC7OI3u6EQ7kNvwFfrC3D&_nc_oc=AdrByClLClazhtjF68qgs4sWlYl2MeOR95C52o2z88aK6y26CP2KYXSS5R3jCrVXs-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRzRUsyUut0vXx0fLVXSibyfYnloCi4fmAONomLzSMVVg&oe=6B0DC87D"}, "display_name": "Subspace Battle Simulator", "keywords": ["battlesimulator", "bs", "simulator", "subspace"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate battlefield with Subspace Battle Simulator: VR Edition! Immerse yourself in chaotic, cartoon-style warfare as you command epic armies across stunning virtual battlefields. Take direct control of legendary warriors, fearsome dragons, and powerful mages, or orchestrate large-scale battles from a god's-eye view. With intuitive VR controls, you'll dodge arrows, cast devastating spells, and lead your troops to victory in real-time. Experience hilarious ragdoll physics, dynamic environmental destruction, and endless strategic possibilities. Whether you're a casual gamer looking for laughs or a strategy enthusiast craving tactical depth, this VR adaptation delivers an unmatched combat experience. ", "short_description": "The game offers a top-down perspective and a first-person VR experience. It is played based on a sandbox simulation and PVE (Player vs. Environment) challenges. The game provides over a dozen different types of combat units, and players can freely combine and configure them to build their own most powerful army to defeat the enemies."}]}, "developer_nam